\section*{Bottom line}
The score is QOBLIB's official objective, computed by the referee \texttt{PortfolioModel.score}; lower
is better. \emph{Gap} = (our score $-$ best known) / $|$best known$|$: \textbf{0\% matches QOBLIB,
negative beats it}. All 122 solution files written were re-scored from disk: all are feasible and
match the referee.

